      "writtenOn": "2024-07-26T23:33:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When initially looking for things to specialize, we use `type().isUnsignedArray()` but throughout the rest of the code, we use `is\u003cFieldAccess\u003e`. Is there a reason we can\u0027t use `parameter-\u003etype().isUnsizedArray()` here?",
