        "id": 3438316
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-29T15:54:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think `is\u003cFieldAccess\u003e` is more future proof along with the change to just use `fActiveSpecialization` since this wouldn\u0027t then just be specific for unsized arrays but for any field access. And since the only two expression types are `VariableReferences` and `FieldAccess`, I think we should be handling the `FieldAccess` case explicitly",
      "parentUuid": "0e29e0b0_c9db8331",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4444,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 4444,
