      "writtenOn": "2024-07-26T23:33:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t this just a subset of the data in our `SpecializedParameters`? Why do we need to build a new map here?\n\nOne approach I used in http://review.skia.org/881296 which might make things simpler for you: I keep track of a `fActiveSpecialization` pointer when writing out each function instantiation. This means I rarely needed to pass around the active specialization (or specialization index) which simplified things a lot, and it would let you access the `SpecializedParameters` during expression handling.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4445,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 4445,
        "endChar": 70
      },
      "revId": "61461e66f0b6a52351c9b99ac4d7c43b39b985ad",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
